            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm">Flavonoids (isorhamnetin, quercetin), carotenoids and polyphenols from the whole berry — not from an isolated oil extract.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <LearnBuyCard
        handle="sujata-sea-buckthorn-capsules"
        lang="en"
        placement="omega7-top"
        badge="Daily Serving • 1-2 Capsules"
        heading="Sujata Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Capsules (650mg × 60)"
        pitch="One month of the 1-2 capsule daily serving. Wild Leh-Ladakh berries, cold-pressed below 40 °C to protect Omega-7. A food supplement, not a medicine."
