          <div class="bg-black/30 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-base mb-2">🍚 Balanced plate</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm">Half the plate vegetables, one quarter protein (dal, paneer, egg), one quarter complex carb (brown rice, millet, roti). Fibre moderates post-meal blood-sugar swings — standard national dietary advice.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/30 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 text-base mb-2">🚶 10,000 steps / day</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm">A daily brisk walk is one of the simplest everyday habits for an active lifestyle. Pair with 30 minutes of moderate movement for best general wellbeing.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/30 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-purple-400 text-base mb-2">💧 Zero sugary drinks</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm">Replace colas and packaged juices with jeera-water, plain buttermilk or nimbu-paani (no sugar). This is common nutritional advice for anyone building better daily habits.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/30 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-base mb-2">😴 7-8 hours of sleep</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm">Sleep is a foundation of metabolic wellbeing. Keep a consistent bedtime and avoid screens 30 minutes before sleep for the cleanest everyday rhythm.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-amber-300/90 bg-amber-950/20 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-xl p-3">
          ⚠️ Sujata Himalayan Sea Buckthorn is a food supplement, not a replacement for any physician-prescribed medication. Always speak with your doctor before adding a supplement to a medical routine.
        </p>
      </article>

      <LearnBuyCard
        handle="sujata-spirulina-sea-buckthorn-combo-pack"
        lang="en"
        placement="omega7-combo"
        badge="Daily Nutrition Combo"
        heading="Spirulina + Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Combo"
        pitch="Pair spirulina's plant protein with sea buckthorn's Omega-7 in a single everyday routine. Two whole-food supplements — not medicines — chosen by customers looking for plant-forward daily nutrition."
        points={["Plant protein + Omega-7 pairing", "1, 2 or 3-month pack", "Free COD pan-India via WhatsApp"]}
      />

      <!-- 3. Reading list -->
      <article class="bg-[#0A1A12] border border-emerald-900/50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">3.</span> Nutrition Reading List
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Publicly indexed nutrition articles on sea buckthorn as a food. Provided for general reading only — not a medical claim and not a recommendation for any health condition.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
