            <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-[11px] uppercase">Nutrients</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-xs mt-1 mb-1.5">Hippophae rhamnoides phytochemistry</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">PMID 28672761 — overview of bioactive nutrients.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15309440/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-emerald-400/40 transition-colors">
            <div class="text-amber-400 font-bold text-[11px] uppercase">J Nutr Biochem</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-xs mt-1 mb-1.5">Palmitoleic acid in epithelial tissue</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">PMID 15309440 — Omega-7 as a dietary fatty acid.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 4. FAQ -->
